<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1906082370"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1630693023"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="雪凪"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="nayuta"/><amll:meta key="album" value="雪凪"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:50.631"><div begin="00:11.577" end="03:41.939"><p begin="00:11.577" end="00:14.566" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">一月、雪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一月 雪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ga tsu yu ki</span></p><p begin="00:16.705" end="00:20.342" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">八月、凪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">八月 风平浪静</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha chi ga tsu na gi</span></p><p begin="00:22.042" end="00:29.723" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">命の音、ふたりの音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生命之音 你我的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi no o to fu ta ri no o to</span></p><p begin="00:32.834" end="00:33.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">いつだってずっとね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论何时 永相伴在身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu da 't te zu 't to ne</span></p><p begin="00:33.953" end="00:36.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">手と手をとりあって生きてきた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我此生都牵着彼此的双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te to te wo to ri a 't te i ki te ki ta</span></p><p begin="00:38.408" end="00:40.069" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">その手を離すことなど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不曾</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no te wo ha na su ko to na do</span></p><p begin="00:40.069" end="00:42.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">絶対になかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">松开过这双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze 't ta i ni na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:43.366" end="00:47.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">僕らを強く動かすその憎しみさえも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连不断推动我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wo tsu yo ku u go ka su</span></p><p begin="00:48.663" end="00:50.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">まだ幼さ残る顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在仍旧稚嫩的脸庞上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da o sa na sa no ko ru ka o</span></p><p begin="00:50.422" end="00:52.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">答えは決まっていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也早已定下了答案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e wa ki ma 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="00:53.490" end="00:59.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">ねえ、聞かせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 让我听到你的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ki ka se te</span></p><p begin="01:04.679" end="01:06.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">ああ、刹那に揺らいだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 刹那间有所动摇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a se tsu na ni yu ra i da</span></p><p begin="01:07.080" end="01:08.883" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">空は赤く染まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空浸染赤红</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra wa a ka ku so ma ru</span></p><p begin="01:10.207" end="01:11.756" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">もうどこにもいかないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再离开我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u do ko ni mo i ka na i de</span></p><p begin="01:12.499" end="01:13.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">僕らここにいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ko ko ni i ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:15.270" end="01:17.329" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ああ、擲つ生涯は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 孤注一掷的此生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a na ge u tsu sho u ga i wa</span></p><p begin="01:17.622" end="01:19.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">鈍く痛み叫ぶ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因钝痛放声呐喊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni bu ku i ta mi sa ke bu</span></p><p begin="01:20.694" end="01:22.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">もう堪え切れないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已无法再忍耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ko ra e ki re na i n da</span></p><p begin="01:23.296" end="01:24.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">だから、声を上げる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 不断提高音量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra ko e wo a ge ru</span></p><p begin="01:25.655" end="01:27.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">僕はここにいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ko ko ni i ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:28.480" end="01:30.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">僕はここにいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ko ko ni i ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:31.514" end="01:32.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">僕らここにいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ko ko ni i ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:33.965" end="01:35.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">僕らここにいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ko ko ni i ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:57.974" end="02:06.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">もういない どこにもいない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已然不见 不论何处都无从找寻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i na i do ko ni mo i na i</span></p><p begin="02:08.641" end="02:16.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">雪は溶けて 凪を待っていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">积雪融化 等待着风平浪静的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ki wa to ke te na gi wo ma 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="02:19.104" end="02:21.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">正しいとか間違っているとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾知晓曾经的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da shi i to ka ma chi ga 't te i ru to ka</span></p><p begin="02:21.671" end="02:23.143" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">何も分からなかったな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是对是错</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n mo wa ka ra na ka 't ta na</span></p><p begin="02:24.844" end="02:26.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">幸せだって不幸せだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幸福或不幸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se da 't te fu shi a wa se da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:27.460" end="02:28.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">誰が決めたのだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都是被谁所决定的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ga ki me ta no da ro u</span></p><p begin="02:30.467" end="02:32.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">ああ、刹那に眩むんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 刹那间感到一阵晕眩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a se tsu na ni ku ra mu n da</span></p><p begin="02:32.969" end="02:34.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">風が強く責める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狂风在强劲地指责着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga tsu yo ku se me ru</span></p><p begin="02:35.494" end="02:37.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">もうここには居られないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已无法继续停留此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ko ko ni wa i ra re na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:38.126" end="02:39.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">この手を離さなきゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须要松开你的双手了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no te wo ha na sa na kya</span></p><p begin="02:40.951" end="02:42.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ああ、脈打つ後悔を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 脉搏击打着心中的后悔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a mya ku u tsu ko u ka i wo</span></p><p begin="02:43.565" end="02:44.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">救い赦す叫び<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐喊着渴望得到拯救宽恕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ku i yu ru su sa ke bi</span></p><p begin="02:46.105" end="02:48.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">もう抱え切れないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已无法将一切全数怀抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ka ka e ki re na i n da</span></p><p begin="02:48.863" end="02:49.959" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">往くよ、ふたりのため<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了你我二人 我将不断向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku yo fu ta ri no ta me</span></p><p begin="02:50.689" end="02:53.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">さあ、もうここでお別れだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在此离别吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a mo u ko ko de o wa ka re da</span></p><p begin="02:53.833" end="02:55.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">違う命をただ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不过是遗忘了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ga u i no chi wo ta da</span></p><p begin="02:57.071" end="03:00.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">精一杯生きて生きて忘れるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人拼尽全力渡过的过往</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i i 'p pa i i ki te i ki te wa su re ru n da</span></p><p begin="03:01.671" end="03:04.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">嫌だ！離れたくないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要 我不想离开你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ya da ha na re ta ku na i yo</span></p><p begin="03:04.666" end="03:05.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">ってその手を離した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但却松开了紧牵的双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">'t te so no te wo ha na shi ta</span></p><p begin="03:07.384" end="03:11.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">姿も名前も過去も失くしたけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我失去了你 遗忘了你的姓名和过去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ga ta mo na ma e mo ka ko mo na ku shi ta ke do</span></p><p begin="03:12.428" end="03:13.967" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">僕はここにいたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾活于此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ko ko ni i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:15.081" end="03:16.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">僕はここにいたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾活于此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ko ko ni i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:17.991" end="03:19.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">僕らここにいたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾活于此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ko ko ni i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:20.453" end="03:22.025" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">僕らここにいたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾活于此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ko ko ni i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:23.525" end="03:25.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">一月、雪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一月 雪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ga tsu yu ki</span></p><p begin="03:29.341" end="03:31.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">八月、凪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">八月 风平浪静</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha chi ga tsu na gi</span></p><p begin="03:34.610" end="03:36.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">あなたは誰？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是谁？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa da re ？</span></p><p begin="03:39.338" end="03:41.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">はじめまして―<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初次见面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me ma shi te</span></p></div></body></tt>